on><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>哈尔滨医科大学2022级、2023级临床医学（“5＋3”一体化）和2025级临床医学（“5＋3”一体化，于维汉班）专业学生。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Pmt1C012Xib8MNU4g4ibEeoAJiaVSpDszykWokqIzcRGNy5gcCJ1ib1fjqN30xzupWThYx0KamIltSTZicIOBeicrYBnZFZJgJwfe5tCusPAQEb6U/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>时间安排</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>报名时间：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>2026年7月7日8:00－7月13日24:00；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动时间：</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><span>拟定于7月20日前后，具体时间另行通知。</span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动内容</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>本次学院开放日采取线下方式进行，时间为1天，活动内容如下：</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院基本情况和学科基本情况介绍；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学生参加意向学科组织的特色沙龙；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学生餐厅就餐；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>参观院史馆，医疗、教学、科研和生活环境；</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>伍连德创新研究基地观摩实验。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>活动申请</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Pmt1C012Xib8Somy210hzr9uLdaYwWJpLEoJoJPiceQPT7cZhtlYSkcgasFicuApPQ1rcnJiajDJsThsORwtBHeibkTajYEIwEQ7xX0VWgG0VtqA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.政治立场坚定，拥护中国共产党领导，品行端正，遵纪守法，恪守诚信；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 身心健康，符合规定的体检标准；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3. 学习成绩优异，专业成绩排名前30％的优先；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4. 具备良好英文科研读写与交流能力，外语成绩需满足下列条件其一：全国大学英语六级考试成绩≥425分，托福iBT≥90分，雅思总分≥6.0分，GRE总分≥305分。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1.填写《哈尔滨医科大学第三临床医学院开放日报名表》（扫描文末二维码），本人签字后，所在学院盖章；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 学习成绩单1份，加盖学校教务部门公章；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3. 英语六级证书或相关英语成绩证明（官方认证的纸质成绩单复印件）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4. 发表论文和获奖等证明材料。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>请按上述顺序，将材料扫描到一个PDF文档中（命名方式：专业＋姓名）。材料力求精简，建议总页数不超过20页，英语水平证明和其他获奖证书采用缩印的形式，图文清晰即可。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span>1. 规定时间内将申请材料发送至指定电子邮箱：hydsyyjsb＠163.com；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2. 学院将统一审核材料，确定开放日来院学生名单，通过邮件或电话方式通知，未入选者，不另行通知；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3. 收到资格审核通过的邮件或电话后，学生需24小时内回复是否确定参加。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Pmt1C012XibibRnGcmsMALhgZz5w6siaGY0kniaiaA7RaGnOFZ4Yhs7vkevPCic1GGFnaVFngLtukZ629aEVr2Swib90RwZmHhH49A97xgRvJGWv8o/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section></section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.本次开放日活动不收取任何费用，为外校学生提供住宿；若对某学科的科学研究感兴趣，可对接研究者交流学习；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>2.学生须遵守相关纪律，全程参加开放日各项活动；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>3.未在规定时间内报名（以接收邮件时间为准）或未在规定时间内回复是否确定参加，视为放弃参加开放日活动；未能参加学院开放日的学生，如有意继续深入了解我院学科，可电话咨询研究生科（详见联系方式）；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>4.提交的材料必须真实、准确，否则将取消资格；</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>5.如活动安排有变化，将会及时在学院官网发布，网站：https://hmucancerhospital.hrbmu.edu.cn/zyb.htm。</span></p></section><section><section><section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系电话</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>0451－86298702</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系人</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>付老师  黄老师</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><p><strong><span><span>请扫描下方二维码下载</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>《哈尔滨医科大学第三临床医学院开放日报名表》</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_png/Pmt1C012Xib901uBbSIV8gGwj4yMno1FmgokV7E7E2icibjZMzsSute523BzQCnejicjdENwKITUNByDmVpdmE5ZGyzgiadEB7gG5gAWfVv5wJ1w/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><span><span>文/研究生科</span></span></section><section><span><span>编辑/柳晴</span></span></section><section><p><span><span>审核/李晓丽</span></span></p><p><span><br/></span></p></section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/KDiaRfb1RV9bABwK4nUB94CzqtUFyApBUS2GPwPU4PJlCd82DDTV5kCciagfdWoTpyle3o4bbMn7PGwgsgNODju